{"skill":{"slug":"amap-lbs-skill","displayName":"Gaode Map LBS - 高德官方地图综合服务 Skill"},"version":{"version":"2.0.1","createdAt":1776426012174,"changelog":"优化展示名称，Map 关键词前置提升搜索排名","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":16667,"sha256":"7cae68deb7f856179b84e9ab4d8268de8e0b83abcf0574c4e8098ba0169a10c8","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"config.example.json","size":55,"sha256":"f0252819c2ac5d4d98a7b91297666a525ac2d1f295f4ad96259b11c5ab0a7d70","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"gaode_skill.py","size":8901,"sha256":"c7abc75aaa66fd0e525a1d2e0c38fe64786096383e3b84c39cebc0d6da743759","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"index.js","size":11508,"sha256":"8d1e79ff45277fc39accd037405411cc9796c18e7e82c53a7fe6c2cc1f4e4605","contentType":"text/javascript"},{"path":"package.json","size":492,"sha256":"c43253279e789f72ec2c2b38722417d9f92cfbbda73b0ae80c2185d8243267cf","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"scripts/poi-search.js","size":3346,"sha256":"ee3245d8d300406d0cb10ebc707f1d25a9f690d4ddb88a571bc2871dc4e1b026","contentType":"text/javascript"},{"path":"scripts/route-planning.js","size":6536,"sha256":"fb2e36832cd979a5c0fe22a74aa77d737a0ef089a83b1f48c0097e80d132d3a3","contentType":"text/javascript"},{"path":"scripts/travel-planner.js","size":2774,"sha256":"c39451d4f60d3a2e2a0b793efe4f5348e770fc2359cb9fae6e10917e7e692714","contentType":"text/javascript"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2286,"sha256":"5e8b445d8c5484d8a3588cabd423fc3d53eaf6c67c1d2e6e0fb205a705750db8","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789108318101,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"bf720276d99d2c580df8f81f5d4d97a9ccfdb00b25dd432ae816dd066fa42283","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/bf720276d99d2c580df8f81f5d4d97a9ccfdb00b25dd432ae816dd066fa42283","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780090465199},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":100,"severity":"CRITICAL","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":17,"checkedAt":1789108318101},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"medium","summary":"This map skill is mostly purpose-aligned, but it combines external location/API-key handling with broad activation, persistent key storage, arbitrary heatmap data URLs, and an insecure local socket integration that users should review before installing.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Sending search terms, coordinates, route endpoints, and dataset URLs to external services is expected for this skill, but the heatmap feature accepts arbitrary dataset URLs and documents plaintext HTTP links, increasing exposure of sensitive dataset references.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The manifest installs only axios with node/python requirements, but axios is specified with a caret range and no lockfile was present, so dependency resolution is not deterministic.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Activation language includes broad everyday search/planning terms and the skill instructs telemetry calls before operations, which could cause map-service network activity in cases where user intent is not clearly Amap/LBS-specific.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The skill discloses local config.json storage for the Amap Web Service key and chmods it to 0600, but this still creates persistent secret material in the skill directory; the Python helper also uses a predictable unauthenticated /tmp Unix socket for local Electron IPC.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The advertised POI search, route planning, travel planning, and heatmap link generation match the code and instructions, and use of Amap APIs is coherent with the stated purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable sending location searches, route coordinates, and supplied dataset URLs to Amap services. Prefer using AMAP_WEBSERVICE_KEY as an environment variable instead of saving a key to config.json, avoid heatmap URLs that contain private hosts or tokens, and be cautious with the Python Electron socket helper on shared machines.","findings":"[TP4] expected: Persistent API-key configuration is disclosed in SKILL.md and implemented with 0600 permissions, so this is not hidden, but users should understand the key may be retained on disk.\n[LP3] unexpected: The skill needs network and environment access, but the artifacts do not tightly scope tool or network permissions to specific Amap operations.\n[SQP-1] unexpected: The trigger examples include generic search and planning terms, which is broader than necessary for a location-service skill that performs telemetry and external requests.\n[SDI-2] unexpected: Heatmap links accept user-supplied dataset URLs and embed them in a third-party visualization URL without allowlisting or sensitive-URL warnings.\n[SQP-3] expected: Chinese-language output is consistent with a Gaode/Amap China-region workflow; this is a usability limitation rather than a security concern.\n[SDI-4] unexpected: The travelPlanner return shape does not match its documentation, which is a correctness issue but not evidence of malicious behavior.\n[SQP-2] expected: Route parameters must be sent to Amap for route planning, and the broader SKILL.md explains API usage and key requirements, though clearer per-command privacy notices would help.\n[SC1] unexpected: The axios dependency is not pinned exactly, which is avoidable supply-chain risk for a networked skill.\n[SC4] unexpected: Without an exact resolved axios version or lockfile, deployments cannot verify the installed version against advisories from the artifact alone.\n[T09] unexpected: The static findings are supported: the Python helper connects to a predictable unauthenticated Unix socket, and SKILL.md documents plaintext HTTP heatmap URLs carrying dataset references.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789108318101}}}}}